# Security

- Passwordless only. Never store passwords.
- Rate-limit auth endpoints. Validate uploads (type + 10 MB).
- Documents are not public; download requires ownership.
- CORS allowlist the web origin. No secrets in the repo.
- Log structured events without emails in bulk or tokens.
